1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:02,989
The announcement itself was three sentences long.

2
00:00:02,989 --> 00:00:05,850
No video, no teaser, no photo.

3
00:00:05,850 --> 00:00:19,304
In an industry that bills a member's return as a comeback special with countdown content, Y-G handled the most anticipated return of the year like a press release from a different decade — and the restraint read as confidence.

4
00:00:19,304 --> 00:00:24,046
The fans who had spent four months organizing welcome projects didn't get a warning.

5
00:00:24,046 --> 00:00:25,051
They got a date.

